<sect1 id="merge__cast_8dox_1merge_cast_intro">
<title>merge_cast.h</title><para>The <computeroutput>merge_cast.h</computeroutput> header contains overloaded template utilities designed to cleanly merge, sum, and contract nested C++ containers like <computeroutput>std::vector</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>std::map</computeroutput>. These templates are extensively used in event aggregation and graph building to combine data from multiple sources efficiently. </para>
</sect1>
